<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico completes five credit auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico completes five credit auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico on Monday completed all five credit auctions and injected 6.463 billion pesos in the secondary market.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM	AVERAGE</p>
<p>1.488 bln pesos    8 days   26.49</p>
<p>1.488 bln pesos    7 days   25.91</p>
<p>1.487 bln pesos    3 days   25.50</p>
<p>1.000 bln pesos    2 days   25.25</p>
<p>1.000 bln pesos    1 day    25.00</p>
<p>NOTE - The average is a percentage.</p>
<p>-- Karina Balderas, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
